@startuml F7.5-D01-listar-templates
title F7.5-D01 — Listar templates e carregar editor
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CTController" as Ctrl
participant "ListTemplatesUseCase" as ListUC
participant "GetTemplateUseCase" as GetUC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: /admin/templates-comunicacao
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /admin/templates-comunicacao
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> ListUC: execute(...)
ListUC -> Postgres: SELECT templates
Postgres --> WebApp: 200 lista
Admin -> WebApp: seleciona template
WebApp -> Jwt: GET .../{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> GetUC: execute(...)
GetUC -> Postgres: SELECT corpo + revisões
Postgres --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: editor duas colunas

@enduml
